    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Bioworks, 대만에 첫 해외 사무소 설립 
    &lt;div id=&#34;bioworks-대만에-첫-해외-사무소-설립&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
